  "description": "Huawei SmartAX MA5600T 16-service-slot all-in-one copper/fibre access platform. Counted here: one H805VDMF 48-port VDSL2-over-POTS board in slot 1 (ports 0/1/0-47, VDSL2 17a/8b, MELT, G.INP, ADSL2+ backwards compatible), one H801X2CS 2-port 10GE SFP+ uplink board in slot 19 (ports 0/19/0-1, SyncE capable), and the SCUN control board's 4x GE optical uplinks (SFP) = 54 ports. 64-port VDPD/VDQM boards raise the line side to 64 per slot.",
