  "notes": "SCUN provides four GE upstream optical ports (SFP). An H801X2CS adds 2x10GE in SFP+ cages (H802X2CS is the same board with 10GE SyncE); H801X2CA is the XFP variant of the same 2x10GE card, which is a different and larger cage - the engine refuses an SFP+ optic in an xfp cage. Board table: 48-channel VDSL2 boards VDJM (over ISDN), VDMF/VCMM (over POTS), VSNL/VSNF splitters; 64-channel VDPD/VDQM raise the line side to 64."
